    <headline>Flood Warning Update — Rivertown flooding now observed</headline>
    <description>Rivulet river has breached banks in Wards 1-4. Water levels at River Gauge RG-01 at 3.2m (danger level 2.5m). Major roads flooded. Power substation SS-02 offline. Evacuate Wards 1-4 immediately.</description>
    <instruction>Evacuate immediately to shelters ST-01, ST-02, ST-03. Do not use Bridge BR-04 (flooded). Emergency services are stretched — only call for life-threatening emergencies.</instruction>
    <area>
      <areaDesc>Rivertown Wards 1-4, Rivulet basin</areaDesc>
